{
  "file": "common childhood",
  "page": 21,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        180.15049743652344,
        27.289522171020508,
        273.88751220703125,
        35.34652328491211
      ],
      "text": "2. METHODOLOGY AND PROCESS",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        59.74208068847656,
        399.12152099609375,
        73.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "The priority areas that were identified included: management of selected neonatal",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        72.74208068847656,
        399.0628967285156,
        86.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "conditions; management of cough or difficulty breathing; antibiotics for treatment",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        85.74208068847656,
        399.1428527832031,
        99.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "of dysentery; management of conditions with fever; antibiotics for severe acute",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        98.74208068847656,
        399.0729675292969,
        112.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "malnutrition; and supportive care (i.e. oxygen therapy, choice of intravenous fluids,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        111.74208068847656,
        192.76290893554688,
        125.2320785522461
      ],
      "text": "and treatment of hypoglycaemia).",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        135.28970336914062,
        276.9019470214844,
        148.47869873046875
      ],
      "text": "2.2\t Evidence retrieval and synthesis process",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        151.91542053222656,
        399.0528869628906,
        165.40542602539062
      ],
      "text": "Throughout 2010, the Department of Maternal, Newborn, Child and Adolescent",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        164.91539001464844,
        399.04296875,
        178.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Health coordinated efforts to review and synthesize the evidence on the various,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        177.91539001464844,
        399.1528015136719,
        191.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "identified priority questions. This process included targeted, systematic reviews of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        190.91539001464844,
        399.0429382324219,
        204.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "relevant literature, preparation of GRADE profiles, and analysis of the risk-benefits,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.91539001464844,
        217.0729522705078,
        217.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "feasibility, and costs of implementation.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        216.91539001464844,
        399.1214904785156,
        230.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "A literature search of the Cochrane Database and OVID-Medline was conducted",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.91539001464844,
        399.15289306640625,
        243.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "in July 2010 to identify high quality, systematic reviews in the last two years that",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        242.91539001464844,
        396.7728271484375,
        256.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "were relevant to the priority PICO questions. Where data were not available or up-to-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        255.91539001464844,
        399.1229248046875,
        269.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "date from the two sources, systematic reviews were commissioned to various groups",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        268.9153747558594,
        399.09283447265625,
        282.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "to collate the evidence. The systematic reviews, meta-analyses, and GRADE profiles",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        281.9153747558594,
        399.07281494140625,
        295.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "followed the methodology recommended by the GRC and as described in Version",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        294.785400390625,
        399.1227722167969,
        308.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "Cochrane Handbook for Systematic Reviews of Interventions 5.1.0 of the  .  Where data  1",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        307.9153747558594,
        399.11285400390625,
        321.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "were lacking, systematic searches were conducted from various electronic databases,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        320.9153747558594,
        399.07293701171875,
        334.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "including Medline/PubMed, Embase, CENTRAL, NLM Gateway, and WHO regional",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        333.9153747558594,
        100.20291900634766,
        347.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "databases.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        346.9153747558594,
        399.1313781738281,
        360.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "For each question, data on critical and secondary outcomes were extracted and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        359.9153747558594,
        399.1126708984375,
        373.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "appraised by evaluating the quality, consistency, and external validity of the evidence.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        372.9153747558594,
        399.1429748535156,
        386.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "These were then graded from very low, low, medium, and high in tabular form using",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        385.9153747558594,
        399.12286376953125,
        399.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "the GRADE methodology. Quality was defined as the extent to which one could be",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        398.9153747558594,
        399.0329895019531,
        412.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "confident that an estimate of effect or association is correct and was based on the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        411.9153747558594,
        128.9228973388672,
        425.4053955078125
      ],
      "text": "following criteria:",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        430.5846862792969,
        123.40179443359375,
        444.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "study design;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        432.8111572265625,
        63.541900634765625,
        441.8111572265625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        443.5846862792969,
        328.36181640625,
        457.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "limitations of the studies, in terms of their conduct and analysis;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        445.8111572265625,
        63.541900634765625,
        454.8111572265625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        456.5846862792969,
        297.5518493652344,
        470.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "the consistency of the results across the available studies;",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        458.8111572265625,
        63.541900634765625,
        467.8111572265625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        469.5846862792969,
        330.65179443359375,
        483.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "the precision of the results (wide or narrow confidence intervals);",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        471.8111572265625,
        63.541900634765625,
        480.8111572265625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        63.54180145263672,
        482.5846862792969,
        399.04168701171875,
        496.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "the directness (or applicability or external validity) of the evidence with respect",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        484.8111572265625,
        63.541900634765625,
        493.8111572265625
      ],
      "text": "n",
      "font": "ZapfDingbats",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        495.5846862792969,
        399.111572265625,
        509.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "to the populations of interest, interventions, and low-resource settings where the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        508.584716796875,
        221.95152282714844,
        522.07470703125
      ],
      "text": "proposed intervention will be applied.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        527.25390625,
        399.10284423828125,
        540.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "Additional considerations included the magnitude of the effect, presence or absence",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        540.25390625,
        304.64288330078125,
        553.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "of a dose response gradient, and direction of plausible biases.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        553.25390625,
        399.10150146484375,
        566.743896484375
      ],
      "text": "The quality of evidence was then categorized as: high, moderate, low, or very low",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        110.33090209960938,
        566.0339965820312,
        147.42092895507812,
        579.7439575195312
      ],
      "text": "Table 2.1",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
